# Reviewed for readable setup and analysis terminology.
#. {ph0}: <a href="../get-started/">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:237
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Setup registers REA's MCP connection and installs the matching investigation"
" skill. Restart your agent when it finishes, then give it a target path and "
"a question. {ph0}Follow the setup guide{ph1} for prerequisites and your "
"first analysis."
msgstr ""
"La configuration enregistre la connexion MCP de REA et installe la skill "
"d’investigation associée. Ensuite, redémarrez votre agent et donnez-lui le "
"chemin du fichier à analyser et une question. Le {ph0}guide de "
"configuration{ph1} présente les prérequis et votre première analyse."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:246
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Which coding agents can use REA?"
msgstr "Quels agents de codage peuvent utiliser REA ?"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:247
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Any agent that supports local MCP servers. Setup includes Claude Code, "
"Claude Desktop, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, Windsurf, Devin, OpenCode, "
"Antigravity, GitHub Copilot CLI, Command Code, Grok Build, OMP, and VS Code."
" Grok Bot's connector is added from its chat."
msgstr ""
"Tout agent qui prend en charge local MCP serveurs. La configuration comprend"
" Claude Code, Claude Bureau, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, Windsurf, Devin, "
"OpenCode, Antigravity, GitHub Copilot CLI, Command Code, Grok Build, OMP, et"
" VS Code. Le connecteur de Grok Bot est ajouté à partir de son chat."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../get-started/#agent">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:254
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Connect your coding agent{ph1}."
msgstr "{ph0}Connectez votre agent de codage{ph1}."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:259
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "How do I update REA?"
msgstr "Comment mettre REA à jour ?"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:260
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"REA releases frequently, including bug fixes. If you installed the CLI with "
"npm:"
msgstr ""
"REA publie fréquemment, y compris des corrections de bogues. Si vous avez "
"installé le modèle CLI avec le modèle npm :"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:266
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Terminal · installed CLI"
msgstr "Terminal * installé sur le CLI"

#. {ph0}: <code>npx</code>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:278
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Follow the setup refresh command printed by the update. If you set up your "
"agent through {ph0}, run:"
msgstr ""
"Suivez la commande d'actualisation de la configuration imprimée par la mise "
"à jour. Si vous configurez votre agent via {ph0}, cours:"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:284
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Terminal · refresh agent setup"
msgstr "Terminal * configuration de l'agent d'actualisation"

# Reviewed for readable setup and analysis terminology.
#. {ph0}: <code>npx -y rea-agents@latest</code>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:296
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Review the changes and restart your agent. Its REA connection pins a package"
" version, so refreshing setup makes it use the new release. For one-off CLI "
"commands, use {ph0} followed by the command."
msgstr ""
"Vérifiez les changements et redémarrez votre agent. La connexion à REA "
"utilise une version précise du paquet : relancez la configuration pour "
"passer à la nouvelle version. Pour une commande CLI ponctuelle, ajoutez la "
"commande après {ph0}."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:304
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Is installing the skill from skills.sh enough?"
msgstr "Installe la compétence à partir de skills.sh assez?"

#. {ph0}: <a href="#install">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:307
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"The skill gives your agent investigation instructions. Run {ph0}REA "
"setup{ph1} to connect the MCP server and install the matching skill, then "
"restart your agent so it can call the tools."
msgstr ""
"La compétence donne des instructions d'enquête à votre agent. Courir {ph0} "
"Configuration du modèle REA{ph1} pour connecter le serveur MCP et installer "
"la compétence correspondante, redémarrez votre agent afin qu'il puisse "
"appeler les outils."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:318
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Analysis"
msgstr "Analyse"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:321
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "What can I analyze with REA?"
msgstr "Que puis-je analyser avec REA ?"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:322
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Start with the kind of software you have:"
msgstr "Commencez avec le type de logiciel que vous avez:"

#. {ph0}: <a href="../guides/native/" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/faq/index.html:324
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Native executables and libraries{ph1}: functions, assembly, pseudocode "
"and references."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Exécutables et bibliothèques natifs{ph1}: fonctions, assembleur, "
"pseudocode et références."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../guides/javascript/" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/faq/index.html:329
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}JavaScript and Electron apps{ph1}: modules, imports, IPC and source "
"locations."
msgstr ""
"{ph0} Applications pour les modèles JavaScript et Electron{ph1}: modules, "
"importations, IPC et emplacements sources."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../guides/browser/">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:334
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Browser pages{ph1}: scripts, requests and runtime observations."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Pages du navigateur{ph1}: scripts, requêtes et observations "
"d'exécution."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../showcase/">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:339
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"REA also has workflows for managed assemblies, Android APKs, firmware and "
"packaged resources. {ph0}See the case studies{ph1} for worked "
"investigations."
msgstr ""
"REA dispose également de flux de travail pour les assemblys gérés, les APK "
"Android, les micrologiciels et les ressources packagées. {ph0}Voir les "
"études de cas{ph1} pour des enquêtes travaillées."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:347
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Do I need Hopper, Ghidra or IDA?"
msgstr "Ai-je besoin des modèles Hopper , Ghidra ou IDA ?"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:348
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Deep native analysis uses one of them. Static JavaScript and .NET inspection"
" work with the supplied files and do not need a native analysis engine."
msgstr ""
"L'analyse approfondie des programmes en code machine utilise l'un d'entre "
"eux. L'inspection statique JavaScript et. NET fonctionne avec les fichiers "
"fournis et ne nécessite pas d'analyse du moteur des programmes de code "
"machine."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../get-started/#native">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:353
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Connect your existing Ghidra or IDA installation, or let setup detect Hopper"
" and propose an installation. Your host and target determine which provider "
"can be used. {ph0}Set up native analysis{ph1}."
msgstr ""
"Connectez votre installation Ghidra ou IDA existante, ou laissez le "
"programme d'installation détecter Hopper et proposer une installation. Votre"
" hôte et votre cible déterminent quel fournisseur peut être utilisé. "
"{ph0}Mettre en place une analyse des programmes en code machine{ph1}."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:361
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Can I use REA without a coding agent?"
msgstr "Puis-je utiliser REA sans agent de codage?"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:362
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Yes. The CLI uses the same analysis workflows. For a local JavaScript or "
"Electron app:"
msgstr ""
"Oui. Le CLI utilise les mêmes workflows d'analyse. Pour une application "
"locale JavaScript ou Electron :"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:368
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "Terminal · static application analysis"
msgstr "Terminal * analyse statique des applications"

#. {ph0}: <a href="../get-started/#terminal">
#. {ph1}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:381
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Replace the path with an extracted application folder or ASAR file. {ph0}Use"
" the CLI{ph1} for installation options."
msgstr ""
"Remplacez le chemin d'accès par un dossier d'application extrait ou un "
"fichier ASAR. {ph0}Utilisez le modèle CLI {ph1} pour les options "
"d'installation."

# Reviewed for readable setup and analysis terminology.
#: website/public/faq/index.html:388
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "What code does REA return?"
msgstr "Quel code REA renvoie-t-il ?"

# Reviewed for readable setup and analysis terminology.
#: website/public/faq/index.html:389
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Native analysis returns assembly and pseudocode, with calls, references and "
"relevant constants. JavaScript analysis returns modules, their relationships"
" and source locations."
msgstr ""
"L’analyse native renvoie de l’assembleur et du pseudocode, avec les appels "
"de fonctions, les références et les constantes utiles. L’analyse JavaScript "
"renvoie les modules, leurs relations et les emplacements dans le code "
"source."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../showcase/dx-ball/#sound-pan" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#. {ph2}: <a href="../showcase/ctf/">
#. {ph3}: </a>
#: website/public/faq/index.html:394
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Your agent uses these findings to explain the behavior or write and test an "
"implementation. The {ph0}DX-Ball calculation{ph1} and {ph2}CTF flag "
"checker{ph3} show how that process works."
msgstr ""
"Votre agent utilise ces résultats pour expliquer le comportement ou écrire "
"et tester une implémentation. Les {ph0} Calcul du DX-Ball{ph1} et "
"{ph2}Vérificateur de drapeau CTF{ph3} montrez comment ce processus "
"fonctionne."

#: website/public/faq/index.html:405
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid "What should I ask my agent?"
msgstr "Que demander à mon agent ?"

#: website/public/faq/index.html:406
msgctxt "page:faq/index.html"
msgid ""
"Give it a local target and one behavior to investigate. For a JavaScript or "
"Electron app:"
msgstr ""
"Donnez-lui une cible locale et un comportement à étudier. Pour une "
"application JavaScript ou Electron :"

