#: website/public/get-started/index.html:371
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Connect your coding agent"
msgstr "Connectez votre agent de codage"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:372
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Run setup to connect REA to your coding agent. Client choices include Claude"
" Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, Windsurf, Grok Build, and other supported "
"MCP clients. Grok Bot's connector is added from its chat."
msgstr ""
"Exécutez la configuration pour vous connecter REA à votre agent de codage. "
"Les choix des clients comprennent Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, "
"Windsurf, Grok Build, et d'autres pris en charge MCP clients. Le connecteur "
"de Grok Bot est ajouté à partir de son chat."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:379
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "New to coding agents?"
msgstr "Nouveau sur les agents de codage?"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:380
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"A coding agent is an AI assistant that works on your computer instead of in "
"a browser tab. It can read files and run commands, and it asks before making"
" changes. REA gives it reverse-engineering tools."
msgstr ""
"Un agent de codage est un assistant IA qui fonctionne sur votre ordinateur "
"plutôt que dans un onglet de navigateur. Il peut lire des fichiers et "
"exécuter des commandes, et il demande avant d'apporter des modifications.  "
"REA lui donne des outils de rétro-ingénierie."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:386
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"If you don't have one yet, pick one, follow its install page and sign in:"
msgstr ""
"Si vous n'en avez pas encore, choisissez-en un, suivez sa page "
"d'installation et connectez-vous:"

#. {ph0}: <strong >
#. {ph1}: <a href="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/setup" >
#. {ph2}: </a >
#. {ph3}: </strong >
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:391
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}{ph1}Claude Code{ph2}{ph3} by Anthropic. Needs a paid Claude plan."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}{ph1}Claude Code{ph2}{ph3} par Anthropic. A besoin d'un payé Claude "
"plan."

#. {ph0}: <strong >
#. {ph1}: <a href="https://github.com/openai/codex">
#. {ph2}: </a>
#. {ph3}: </strong >
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:399
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}{ph1}Codex{ph2}{ph3} by OpenAI. Sign in with your ChatGPT account."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}{ph1}Codex{ph2}{ph3} par OpenAI. Connectez-vous avec votre compte "
"ChatGPT."

#. {ph0}: <strong >
#. {ph1}: <a href="https://opencode.ai/docs">
#. {ph2}: </a>
#. {ph3}: </strong >
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:405
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}{ph1}OpenCode{ph2}{ph3}, open source. Connect the model provider of "
"your choice."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}{ph1}OpenCode{ph2}{ph3}, code source ouvert. Connectez le fournisseur "
"de modèle de votre choix."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:411
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Then open it and copy the prompt below into it. The agent runs REA's setup "
"and shows you the plan before changing anything."
msgstr ""
"Ensuite, ouvrez-le et copiez l'invite ci-dessous dedans. L'agent exécute la "
"configuration de REA et vous montre le plan avant de modifier quoi que ce "
"soit."

#. {ph0}: <span class="terminal-dots" aria-hidden="true" >
#. {ph1}: <i>
#. {ph2}: </i>
#. {ph3}: <i>
#. {ph4}: </i>
#. {ph5}: <i>
#. {ph6}: </i>
#. {ph7}: </span >
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:418
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}Your coding agent"
msgstr "{ph0}{ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}Votre agent de codage"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:443
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Or run setup yourself"
msgstr "Ou exécutez la configuration vous-même"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:445
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "How do I open a terminal?"
msgstr "Comment ouvrir un terminal?"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <em>
#. {ph3}: </em>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:447
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Windows:{ph1} open the Start menu, type {ph2}PowerShell{ph3} and press "
"Enter."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Windows:{ph1} ouvrez le menu Démarrer, tapez {ph2}PowerShell{ph3} et "
"appuyez sur Entrée."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <kbd>⌘</kbd>
#. {ph3}: <kbd>Space</kbd>
#. {ph4}: <em>
#. {ph5}: </em>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:451
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}macOS:{ph1} press {ph2} {ph3}, type {ph4}Terminal{ph5} and press Enter."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}macOS:{ph1} presse {ph2} {ph3}, type {ph4}Borne{ph5} et appuyez sur "
"Entrée."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>
#. {ph3}: <kbd>Alt</kbd>
#. {ph4}: <kbd>T</kbd>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:455
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Linux:{ph1} press {ph2} {ph3} {ph4} on most desktops."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Linux:{ph1} presse {ph2} {ph3} {ph4} sur la plupart des ordinateurs de "
"bureau."

#. {ph0}: <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>
#. {ph1}: <kbd>V</kbd>
#. {ph2}: <kbd>⌘</kbd>
#. {ph3}: <kbd>V</kbd>
#. {ph4}: <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>
#. {ph5}: <kbd>Shift</kbd>
#. {ph6}: <kbd>V</kbd>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:460
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Paste a command with {ph0} {ph1} (macOS: {ph2} {ph3}; Linux terminals: {ph4}"
" {ph5} {ph6}), then press Enter."
msgstr ""
"Collez une commande avec {ph0} {ph1} (macOS: {ph2} {ph3}; Linux terminaux: "
"{ph4} {ph5} {ph6}), puis appuyez sur Entrée."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:481
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Choose your client and review the setup plan. REA adds its MCP connection "
"and the matching investigation skill, keeping a backup of existing "
"configuration. It asks before applying the changes."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez votre client et consultez le plan d'installation.  REA ajoute sa "
"connexion MCP et la compétence d'investigation correspondante, en conservant"
" une sauvegarde de la configuration existante. Il demande avant d'appliquer "
"les modifications."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:486
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Restart your client when setup finishes."
msgstr "Redémarrez votre client une fois la configuration terminée."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:488
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "How do I restart my client?"
msgstr "Comment puis-je redémarrer mon client?"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <kbd>⌘</kbd>
#. {ph3}: <kbd>Q</kbd>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:489
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Desktop apps{ph1} (Claude Desktop, Cursor, Windsurf, VS Code): quit the"
" app completely, then open it again. Closing the window isn't enough. On "
"macOS press {ph2} {ph3}; on Windows, also quit from the tray icon if there "
"is one."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Applications de bureau{ph1} (Claude Bureau, Cursor, Windsurf, VS Code):"
" quittez complètement l'application, puis ouvrez-la à nouveau. Fermer la "
"fenêtre ne suffit pas. Sur macOS presse {ph2} {ph3}; sur Windows, quittez "
"également l'icône de la barre d'état s'il y en a une."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:496
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Terminal agents{ph1} (Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI): exit the session"
" and start it again."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Agents terminaux{ph1} (Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI): quittez la "
"session et recommencez-la."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:501
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Give your agent a target path and a specific question. For a JavaScript or "
"Electron app, you might start with:"
msgstr ""
"Donnez à votre agent un chemin cible et une question spécifique. Pour une "
"application JavaScript ou Electron, vous pouvez commencer par:"

#. {ph0}: <code>/absolute/path/to/app</code>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:506
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Look at {ph0} and find how it exports data. Show the entry points, calls and"
" dependencies involved, with the source locations for your findings."
msgstr ""
"Regarde {ph0} et découvrez comment il exporte les données. Affichez les "
"points d'entrée, les appels et les dépendances impliqués, avec les "
"emplacements sources de vos résultats."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:512
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Replace the path with your local target."
msgstr "Remplacez le chemin par votre cible locale."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:514
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "How do I get a folder's full path?"
msgstr "Comment puis-je obtenir le chemin d'accès complet d'un dossier?"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <em>
#. {ph3}: </em>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:516
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Windows:{ph1} in File Explorer, right-click the folder and choose "
"{ph2}Copy as path{ph3}. On Windows 10, hold Shift while right-clicking."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Windows:{ph1} dans l'Explorateur de fichiers, cliquez avec le bouton "
"droit sur le dossier et choisissez {ph2}Copier comme chemin{ph3}. Sur "
"Windows 10, maintenez la touche Maj enfoncée tout en cliquant avec le bouton"
" droit."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <em>
#. {ph3}: </em>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:521
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}macOS:{ph1} in Finder, right-click the folder, hold Option and choose "
"{ph2}Copy \"…\" as Pathname{ph3}."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}macOS:{ph1} dans le Finder, cliquez avec le bouton droit sur le "
"dossier, maintenez l'option enfoncée et choisissez {ph2}Copiez \" ... \" "
"comme chemin d'accès{ph3}."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:525
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Any system:{ph1} drag the folder into a terminal window and its path "
"appears."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}Tout système:{ph1} faites glisser le dossier dans une fenêtre de "
"terminal et son chemin apparaît."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:530
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "In a terminal, put quotes around a path that contains spaces."
msgstr ""
"Dans un terminal, mettez des guillemets autour d'un chemin qui contient des "
"espaces."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:537
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Use the CLI"
msgstr "Utilisez le modèle CLI"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:538
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Analyze a JavaScript or Electron application folder or ASAR archive without "
"running the app:"
msgstr ""
"Analysez un dossier d'application JavaScript ou Electron ou une archive ASAR"
" sans exécuter l'application:"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:544
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Static application analysis"
msgstr "Analyse statique des applications"

#. {ph0}: <code>.asar</code>
#. {ph1}: <code>"D:/apps/example"</code>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:557
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Replace the path with your extracted app directory or {ph0} file. On "
"Windows, a path such as {ph1} works here."
msgstr ""
"Remplacez le chemin par le répertoire de votre application extraite ou {ph0}"
" dossier. Sur Windows, un chemin tel que {ph1} travaille ici."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:563
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Where do I find an app's .asar file?"
msgstr "Où puis-je trouver une application .fichier asar?"

#. {ph0}: <code>resources</code>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:564
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Electron apps usually keep it in a {ph0} folder:"
msgstr ""
"Les applications Electron le conservent généralement dans un {ph0} dossier:"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code
#. >C:\Users\&lt;you&gt;\AppData\Local\Programs\&lt;App&gt;\resources\app.asar</code
#. >
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:569
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Windows:{ph1} {ph2}"
msgstr "{ph0}Windows:{ph1} {ph2}"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code
#. >/Applications/&lt;App&gt;.app/Contents/Resources/app.asar</code >
#. {ph3}: <em>
#. {ph4}: </em>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:575
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}macOS:{ph1} {ph2} (right-click the app and choose {ph3}Show Package "
"Contents{ph4})"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}macOS:{ph1} {ph2} (faites un clic droit sur l'application et choisissez"
" {ph3}Afficher Le Contenu de l'Emballage{ph4})"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <code>/opt/&lt;App&gt;/resources/app.asar</code>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:583
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Linux:{ph1} often {ph2}"
msgstr "{ph0}Linux:{ph1} souvent {ph2}"

#. {ph0}: <code>app.asar</code>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:588
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Some apps install elsewhere. Search the app's folder for {ph0}."
msgstr ""
"Certaines applications s'installent ailleurs. Recherchez le dossier de "
"l'application pour {ph0}."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:593
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"The result identifies the app, shows connections between modules and gives "
"their source locations. Connections REA cannot resolve are marked in the "
"result."
msgstr ""
"Le résultat identifie l'application, montre les connexions entre les modules"
" et donne leurs emplacements sources. Les connexions que REA ne peut pas "
"résoudre sont marquées dans le résultat."

#. {ph0}: <code>rea</code>
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:598
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "If you'd like a permanent {ph0} command in your shell:"
msgstr "Si vous souhaitez un permanent {ph0} commande dans votre shell:"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:603
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Install the CLI"
msgstr "Installez le CLI"

#. {ph0}: <a href="../guides/javascript/" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/get-started/index.html:615
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Continue with the JavaScript application guide{ph1}"
msgstr "{ph0}Continuez avec le guide d'application JavaScript{ph1}"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:623
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Set up native analysis"
msgstr "Mettre en place une analyse des programmes en code machine"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:624
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Native binaries need a local analysis tool. Choose and configure one below, "
"then give REA your executable or library."
msgstr ""
"Les programmes en code machine ont besoin d'un outil d'analyse local. "
"Choisissez et configurez-en un ci-dessous, puis donnez à REA votre "
"exécutable ou bibliothèque."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:629
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Choose a tool: Ghidra, Hopper or IDA"
msgstr "Choisissez un outil: Ghidra, Hopper ou IDA"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:634
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Use an existing Ghidra 12.1.x installation and a 64-bit JDK 21 or newer on "
"Linux or macOS, on x64 or arm64. Your Ghidra installation needs a native "
"decompiler for your host architecture. Set the paths before running setup:"
msgstr ""
"Utilisez un Ghidra 12.1 existant.installation x et un JDK 64 bits 21 ou plus"
" récent sur Linux ou macOS, sur x64 ou arm64. Votre installation Ghidra "
"nécessite un décompilateur natif pour votre architecture hôte. Définissez "
"les chemins avant d'exécuter le programme d'installation:"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:641
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Connect your Ghidra installation"
msgstr "Connectez votre installation de Ghidra"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:644
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Ghidra connection · macOS / Linux"
msgstr "Ghidra de la connexion · macOS / Linux"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:659
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Replace both paths with your existing installations. Setup checks them and "
"records valid settings for your selected client. On Linux arm64, you may "
"need to build Ghidra's native decompiler separately."
msgstr ""
"Remplacez les deux chemins par vos installations existantes. Le programme "
"d'installation les vérifie et enregistre les paramètres valides pour le "
"client sélectionné. Sur Linux arm64, vous devrez peut-être créer séparément "
"le décompilateur natif de Ghidra."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:667
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Connect Ghidra on Windows"
msgstr "Connectez le modèle Ghidra sur le modèle Windows"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:668
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Windows x64 has experimental, read-only support for native x86 and x64 PE "
"applications and DLLs on fixed local NTFS drives. Use an existing Ghidra "
"12.1.x installation and a 64-bit JDK 21 or newer:"
msgstr ""
"Windows x64 a un support expérimental en lecture seule pour les applications"
" et DLL natives x86 et x64 PE sur des lecteurs NTFS locaux fixes. Utilisez "
"un Ghidra 12.1 existant.installation x et un JDK 64 bits 21 ou plus récent:"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:676
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid "Ghidra connection · Windows PowerShell"
msgstr "Ghidra connexion · Windows PowerShell"

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:691
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Replace the two paths with your installations, then review setup's plan."
msgstr ""
"Remplacez les deux chemins par vos installations, puis passez en revue le "
"plan de configuration."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:701
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"Connect Hopper on macOS or Linux. Run the setup command above; it detects an"
" existing installation or offers an installation plan for your approval."
msgstr ""
"Connectez Hopper sur macOS ou Linux. Exécutez la commande d'installation ci-"
"dessus; il détecte une installation existante ou propose un plan "
"d'installation pour votre approbation."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:706
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"On macOS, complete Hopper's first-run choice of demo mode or license "
"activation before an unattended analysis."
msgstr ""
"Sur macOS, effectuez le choix de première exécution de Hopper entre le mode "
"de démonstration ou l'activation de la licence avant une analyse sans "
"surveillance."

#: website/public/get-started/index.html:715
msgctxt "page:get-started/index.html"
msgid ""
"The verified IDA setups use Windows, with an existing MCP registration for "
"an attached GUI or a headless database. Linux and macOS headless analysis "
"remains unverified."
msgstr ""
"Les configurations IDA vérifiées utilisent Windows, avec un enregistrement "
"MCP existant pour une interface graphique attachée ou une base de données "
"sans en-tête.  Les analyses sans tête Linux et macOS restent non vérifiées."

